# Changelog

## [1.1.0] - 2026-10-15

### Changed
- Refactored the original single-file Playwright test implementation into a modular, end-to-end automation framework using the Page Object Model (POM).
- Separated page objects, test specifications, test data, utilities, and runner logic into dedicated directories.
- Improved code reusability and maintainability through shared utilities and fixtures.
- Organized Login, Dashboard, and Fund Transfer tests into separate specification files.
- Integrated automated Allure report generation into the framework runner.
- Integrated framework execution with GitHub Actions CI.

## [1.0.0] - Initial Release

### Added
- Initial Playwright automation implementation with test code in a single file.
- Initial browser automation and test execution.
